# No Auto-Generated Liquibase Changelogs

Do NOT create or modify any Liquibase changelog files (e.g. `*_changelog.xml`, `db.changelog-master.xml`) unless the user explicitly asks for it.

Schema changes (new columns, tables, indexes) should only be reflected in the Java entity class. The developer will write the Liquibase migration manually.
